{
  "chapter_group.4755489B04766E01.title": "&6Het Guhpad",
  "chapter.475548FB06F5DC45.title": "&dVerhalen van de Guhmensie",
  "chapter.475548FB06F5DC45.chapter_subtitle": [
    "1. De grote verhalen van de roze wereld. Hier begint het Guhpad, njeg!",
  ],
  "task.4755487A079F405B.title": "Stap door je guhportaal de Guhmensie in",
  "quest.475548976F9E59F7.title": "Het Guhpad begint hier",
  "quest.475548976F9E59F7.quest_desc": [
    "Dit is het begin van &6het Guhpad&r: de grote verhalen openen de werelden. Eerst de &dGuhmensie&r, dan de &6Guhbarbecuether&r, dan het &5Guheinde&r. &dDit hoofdstuk zit niet op slot&r: stap door je guhportaal en je bent er.",
    "",
    "Kies in je &6superkompas&r de keuze &dMijn verhaal&r: het wijst naar het dichtstbijzijnde verhaal dat je nog niet hebt gedaan. De plekken zelf staan in de tab &dVerhalen&r.",
    "",
    "De grote verhalen van de Guhmensie: &fNomguh&r in de witte Sneeuwguhtoendra (Baltoguh!), het &5kloon-eiland&r in de Diepe Guhzee (Guhtwo!), het &dHemelkapelletje&r hoog in de wolken en de eilandjes van &bGuhwai'i&r (626-guh!).",
    "",
    "Heb je ze allemaal gevolgd? Dan wacht &dGuhdalf&r op je met de Knabbelring en gaat het volgende hoofdstuk open. De &6Timmerguh&r, het surfen en de andere rijtjes hier tellen daar niet voor mee: die zijn er voor de gezelligheid. Hier kun je alles in elke volgorde doen.",
  ],
  "quest.475548743CAEF30F.title": "Once Upon a Guh...",
  "quest.475548743CAEF30F.quest_desc": [
    "Your &6Super Compass&r has a new tab: &dTales&r. Pick a place and follow the needle: Nomguh, Clone Island, the Cloud Chapel, the islands of Guhwai'i or the Carpenter Guh's building site. Every tale ends with a new friend. Nyeg!",
  ],
  "quest.47554830C71BF963.title": "The Snowguh Tundra",
  "quest.47554830C71BF963.quest_desc": [
    "Somewhere next to the Guh Peaks lies a white, hilly land full of snow: the &fSnowguh Tundra&r. Put on a warm scarf! In the middle of the tundra lies the guh town of &fNomguh&r...",
  ],
  "quest.475548AC74F40C61.title": "Guhwai'i",
  "quest.475548AC74F40C61.quest_desc": [
    "In the Deep Guh Sea lie tropical islands: &bGuhwai'i&r! Warm sand, a shallow lagoon and palm trees. Aloha, nyeg!",
  ],
  "quest.47554853FC6CD7BA.title": "Up in the Clouds",
  "quest.47554853FC6CD7BA.quest_desc": [
    "Sometimes a tame guh goes &dup in the clouds&r for a while. Nyeg... But nothing is ever gone: its &ddiary&r stays in your Guhdex (My Guhs tab), a glowing &dmemory star&r is left behind, and high up in the sky beats the &dSnuggleheart&r, which can bring it back. Tick this off once you know.",
  ],
  "quest.475548E50055AA9D.title": "The Carpenter Guh",
  "quest.475548E50055AA9D.quest_desc": [
    "On the edge of every &dSnuggledale town&r (walk all the way down the street past Coco's house: follow the sign) there's a building site. That's where the &6Carpenter Guh&r is building a guh house: a little house shaped like a guh head. Say hello!",
  ],
  "quest.47554886FDACFF65.title": "Planks and Pink Wool",
  "quest.47554886FDACFF65.quest_desc": [
    "The Carpenter Guh needs &616 planks&r (any wood) and &d8 pink wool&r for the ear roof. Bring them to the building site!",
  ],
  "quest.47554878D43ADB9F.title": "Topping Out!",
  "quest.47554878D43ADB9F.quest_desc": [
    "Climb the scaffolding and right-click every see-through spot of the roof with a &droof fluff&r. Don't forget the ears! When the last spot is filled, up goes the flag.",
  ],
  "quest.4755483FA1B44534.title": "Our First House",
  "quest.4755483FA1B44534.quest_desc": [
    "The Carpenter Guh gives you a small &dGuh House&r. Put it down at your home and let one of your tame guhs live in it (right-click the house: New Resident).",
  ],
  "quest.4755483337CA6C0B.title": "Building a House Together",
  "quest.4755483337CA6C0B.quest_desc": [
    "Tell the Carpenter Guh: you get his &6building booklet&r! With it you can make all three Guh Houses yourself (the booklet stays in your crafting table). Plus another small house as a gift and a little carpenter's helmet.",
  ],
  "quest.4755480841699CBA.title": "Carpenter's Helmet",
  "quest.4755480841699CBA.quest_desc": [
    "A cream-colored little helmet with a pink crest and a heart sticker. Hold it (keep right-click pressed) to unlock it, and dress your guh in it at the wardrobe!",
  ],
  "quest.47554832D698C78E.title": "Cozily Furnished",
  "quest.47554832D698C78E.quest_desc": [
    "An extra chore from the Carpenter Guh: put a &dtoy&r (slide, seesaw, swing, tunnel or nibble ball) and a &6guh lamp&r in the home area of one of your houses, and tell him.",
  ],
  "quest.475548B80D17EF59.title": "Tool Belt",
  "quest.475548B80D17EF59.quest_desc": [
    "The Carpenter Guh's very own tool belt, with a little hammer, a yellow folding ruler and a nail pouch. Tap tap, nyeg!",
  ],
  "quest.475548E994E44EBC.title": "Nomguh",
  "quest.475548E994E44EBC.quest_desc": [
    "In the middle of the &fSnowguh Tundra&r lies &fNomguh&r, a snowy guh town with colorful houses, a little hospital and a sled dog stable. Your &6Super Compass&r (Tales tab) shows the way. Put on a warm scarf, nyeg!",
  ],
  "quest.47554843F5A4EE51.title": "The Odd One Out",
  "quest.47554843F5A4EE51.quest_desc": [
    "By an old boat on the frozen bay sits &7Baltoguh&r: half guh, half wolf. The other guhs think he's weird, and &cSteele Mika&r laughs at him. Say hello!",
  ],
  "quest.47554809861C12FD.title": "Achoo-Nyeg!",
  "quest.47554809861C12FD.quest_desc": [
    "In the &dlittle hospital&r (the white house with the pink heart) the guh babies are all sniffly. &dRosy&r has the nibble cough, and the medicine has run out! The new medicine chest is in the mountain hut on the Nomguh Peaks...",
  ],
  "quest.4755483DF474A8D7.title": "Da, Little Guh... Honk!",
  "quest.4755483DF474A8D7.quest_desc": [
    "&7Boris&r is a real goose (not a guh!) with a fur hat. He knows the way through the storm: follow the &cred poles&r with the little lights. And take Baltoguh along, his nose is the best in Nomguh.",
  ],
  "quest.47554814A4564DDC.title": "Through the Snowstorm",
  "quest.47554814A4564DDC.quest_desc": [
    "Tell Baltoguh: off to the mountain hut! You steer the snow sled, Baltoguh and the guh sled pups pull. Through Storm Valley, over the Ice Bridge, past Avalanche Mountain, a rest by the fire baskets... and grab the &dmedicine chest&r in the mountain hut.",
  ],
  "quest.475548AE533E2A28.title": "The White Wolf Guh",
  "quest.475548AE533E2A28.quest_desc": [
    "On the way back the storm is too fierce. Baltoguh has lost the way... Then a white wolf guh appears, and you hear Boris' words. Howl along!",
  ],
  "quest.47554879F59848E5.title": "But Maybe... a Baltoguh Can",
  "quest.47554879F59848E5.quest_desc": [
    "Get back to Nomguh in time (Steele Mika wants the credit, of course, nyeh-heh) and bring the medicine chest to Rosy. Everyone in Nomguh will then call you the &6Hero of Nomguh&r! You get your own &fsnow sled&r, the &6Baltoguh Statuette&r and four warm outfits.",
  ],
  "quest.475548D6161C77DD.title": "A Baltoguh of Your Own",
  "quest.475548D6161C77DD.quest_desc": [
    "After the tale, Baltoguh wants to come home with you (just once, and only for you). In the snow he runs super wahoog fast, even when you ride him.",
  ],
  "quest.47554868600A8821.title": "Sniff Sniff, Home We Go!",
  "quest.47554868600A8821.quest_desc": [
    "In your Baltoguh's guh menu, press &bSniff!&r: he smells the way to your house (or your bed) and glowing pawprints light up in the snow. Just follow them!",
  ],
  "quest.475548C639BCD466.title": "A Hero on a Pedestal",
  "quest.475548C639BCD466.quest_desc": [
    "Put your &6Baltoguh Statuette&r somewhere nice. Click it for the famous words.",
  ],
  "quest.4755483B182BC19C.title": "Red Scarf",
  "quest.4755483B182BC19C.quest_desc": [
    "Baltoguh's red scarf, with a little knot and two fluttering ends. A reward for the Hero of Nomguh.",
  ],
  "quest.475548E8CE537E42.title": "Wolf Ears",
  "quest.475548E8CE537E42.quest_desc": [
    "Pointy gray wolf ears for every guh (on top of the guh ears). A reward for the Hero of Nomguh.",
  ],
  "quest.4755483CB05903D4.title": "Bobble Snow Hat",
  "quest.4755483CB05903D4.quest_desc": [
    "An ice-blue hat with snowflakes, a big fat pompom and two little braids. A reward for the Hero of Nomguh.",
  ],
  "quest.475548BD5CA4E49C.title": "Mittens on a String",
  "quest.475548BD5CA4E49C.quest_desc": [
    "Red mittens for the front paws, on a string: never lost again, nyeg! A reward for the Hero of Nomguh.",
  ],
  "quest.47554850126FD9C6.title": "Muk and Luk",
  "quest.47554850126FD9C6.quest_desc": [
    "By the igloo at the little ice pond live two sweet polar bear guhs: &bMuk&r and &aLuk&r. Say hello to both (Luk doesn't say anything back, but cuddles all the more).",
  ],
  "quest.475548F7BCBE76A2.title": "Guhdex: Baltoguh",
  "quest.475548F7BCBE76A2.quest_desc": [
    "Add &dBaltoguh&r to your Guhdex (get close).",
  ],
  "quest.4755488660648836.title": "Guhdex: Boris",
  "quest.4755488660648836.quest_desc": [
    "Add &dBoris&r to your Guhdex (get close).",
  ],
  "quest.4755483CE24DFBB7.title": "Guhdex: Steele Mika",
  "quest.4755483CE24DFBB7.quest_desc": [
    "Add &dSteele Mika&r to your Guhdex (get close).",
  ],
  "quest.47554895DEF6ECE9.title": "Guhdex: Muk",
  "quest.47554895DEF6ECE9.quest_desc": [
    "Add &dMuk&r to your Guhdex (get close).",
  ],
  "quest.475548047E33526A.title": "Guhdex: Luk",
  "quest.475548047E33526A.quest_desc": [
    "Add &dLuk&r to your Guhdex (get close).",
  ],
  "quest.475548840776FA87.title": "Guhdex: Rosy",
  "quest.475548840776FA87.quest_desc": [
    "Add &dRosy&r to your Guhdex (get close).",
  ],
  "quest.475548048B5E563A.title": "Guhdex: The White Wolf Guh",
  "quest.475548048B5E563A.quest_desc": [
    "Add &dThe White Wolf Guh&r to your Guhdex (get close, only at the darkest moment of the journey).",
  ],
  "quest.47554892EB342F35.title": "Through the Snowstorm",
  "quest.47554892EB342F35.quest_desc": [
    "Rosy and the baby guhs in Nomguh need the medicine! Steer the &bsled&r yourself, with &fBaltoguh&r in the lead: through the snowstorm to the mountain hut and then back to the little hospital in time. &6W&r = hup hup, &6S&r = brake, &6A/D&r = steer. Can't see a thing? Follow Baltoguh's glowing sniff stars.",
  ],
  "quest.475548D2BEF62D30.title": "Warm Pawsies",
  "quest.475548D2BEF62D30.quest_desc": [
    "Along the way there are &6fire baskets&r. Slow down and stop there for a moment: the sled pups warm their paws. Cold paws are slow paws: stop at least once every trek, or they start to dawdle!",
  ],
  "quest.4755482608E11517.title": "Over the Ice Bridge",
  "quest.4755482608E11517.quest_desc": [
    "The &bIce Bridge&r is narrow and slippery: the sled keeps sliding when you steer. Easy does it, and stay in the middle. Fall off? You land in soft snow and get to try again.",
  ],
  "quest.4755489FA5E6202E.title": "Avalanche, Look Out!",
  "quest.4755489FA5E6202E.quest_desc": [
    "Rumbling up on the slope? An &favalanche&r! Steer to the &eother side&r of the route before the snow rolls over it. Too late? FLOMP, snowed under: the sled pups dig you out.",
  ],
  "quest.475548BD37387B6E.title": "Your Own Snow Sled",
  "quest.475548BD37387B6E.quest_desc": [
    "After the tale of Nomguh you get your &down snow sled&r with four guh sled pups. Put it down on snow and ride 200 blocks through the white tundra (or another snowy land). They only run on snow and ice! A cheese nibble makes them extra happy.",
  ],
  "quest.4755486D640012A2.title": "Sled Sprint: Easy",
  "quest.4755486D640012A2.quest_desc": [
    "Race against &5Steele Mika&r (at the Nomguh starting line) on &eeasy&r: to the mountain hut, around it and back. Your time goes on the scoreboard and in your Guhdex (Minigames).",
  ],
  "quest.475548DF1E51FA4B.title": "Sled Sprint: Medium",
  "quest.475548DF1E51FA4B.quest_desc": [
    "Race against &5Steele Mika&r (at the Nomguh starting line) on &emedium&r: to the mountain hut, around it and back. Your time goes on the scoreboard and in your Guhdex (Minigames).",
  ],
  "quest.475548308A93417A.title": "Sled Sprint: Hard",
  "quest.475548308A93417A.quest_desc": [
    "Race against &5Steele Mika&r (at the Nomguh starting line) on &ehard&r: to the mountain hut, around it and back. Your time goes on the scoreboard and in your Guhdex (Minigames).",
  ],
  "quest.47554863D204E31C.title": "Faster Than Steele Mika",
  "quest.47554863D204E31C.quest_desc": [
    "Win the sled sprint against &5Steele Mika&r. He'll probably say it was the wind. All the guhs of Nomguh giggle sweetly.",
  ],
  "quest.47554889E3DB2DEB.title": "Champion of Nomguh",
  "quest.47554889E3DB2DEB.quest_desc": [
    "Win the sled sprint on &chard&r. Then you're the fastest musher in all of Nomguh. Nyeh-heh... er, WAHOOG!",
  ],
  "quest.475548ACFF53EA0F.title": "Winter Goodies",
  "quest.475548ACFF53EA0F.quest_desc": [
    "Steele Mika has a little shop: a snow guh, a mini sled, sleigh bells, a trail lantern, a sled pup basket and the golden Sled Sprint Cup. Buy the &6sleigh bell arch&r for your sleigh bells.",
  ],
  "quest.475548A48E5EA549.title": "Clone Island",
  "quest.475548A48E5EA549.quest_desc": [
    "Somewhere in the &9Deep Guh Sea&r stands a rocky island with a glass dome and an arena on top. Find &5Clone Island&r (Super Compass: Tales) and walk up the little jetty.",
  ],
  "quest.475548B890587530.title": "Professor Nibbleclone",
  "quest.475548B890587530.quest_desc": [
    "In the messy little office next to the dome hall sits &6Professor Nibbleclone&r, his glasses all crooked. Say hello and promise to look for his lab notes.",
  ],
  "quest.4755488334C58CBF.title": "Six Lab Notes",
  "quest.4755488334C58CBF.quest_desc": [
    "Find the six &6Lab Notes&r: in the little office, in the dome hall, by the clone tank, at the top of the tower stairs and in the boathouse. Read them (right-click) and bring them to the professor. You get the &dTrainer Cap&r!",
  ],
  "quest.475548DE771F2FBD.title": "Blub, Blub, Fixed!",
  "quest.475548DE771F2FBD.quest_desc": [
    "Find the four &6Tank Parts&r in the parts chests (boathouse, little office, tower, stands) and fit them into the cracked &5Clone Tank&r in the dome hall (right-click the tank).",
  ],
  "quest.4755486749D00FF0.title": "Hee Hee Hee!",
  "quest.4755486749D00FF0.quest_desc": [
    "Once the tank is bubbling again, someone comes to take a look: &dMewguh&r, a tiny pink floating guh. Add her to your Guhdex! After the tale she always floats around Clone Island.",
  ],
  "quest.47554835EC9EF7E8.title": "A Double Helping",
  "quest.47554835EC9EF7E8.quest_desc": [
    "Bring &632 cheese nibbles&r and &62 snacks&r to the big nibble bowl in the arena (right-click the bowl). Guhtwo and Mewguh feast together: x2! You get the Guhtwo Tail and the Little Mewguh Balloon.",
  ],
  "quest.4755481B26643C2E.title": "x2, Nyeg!",
  "quest.4755481B26643C2E.quest_desc": [
    "Then click the &5Guhtwo&r in the arena and take him home (one per player). He floats, floats over small gaps with you on his back, pulls cheese nibbles within 8 blocks towards himself and eats everything double.",
  ],
  "quest.4755484B477E499D.title": "Nibble Telekinesis",
  "quest.4755484B477E499D.quest_desc": [
    "Throw a cheese nibble a few blocks away from your Guhtwo and watch him float it over to himself. (The Telekinesis button in his guh menu turns it on and off.)",
  ],
  "quest.4755488CF3D09E28.title": "Double Delicious",
  "quest.4755488CF3D09E28.quest_desc": [
    "Give your Guhtwo a snack: he feasts x2 and gets double hearts. WAHOOG!",
  ],
  "quest.475548E070BF3773.title": "The Trainer Cap",
  "quest.475548E070BF3773.quest_desc": [
    "From the professor, for the six lab notes. With our very own logo: the nibble ball with guh ears!",
  ],
  "quest.4755481E470D8DA7.title": "The Trainer Outfit",
  "quest.4755481E470D8DA7.quest_desc": [
    "From the professor, once the clone tank is bubbling again: a lilac vest and a little backpack with a nibble ball.",
  ],
  "quest.475548D23419D0BB.title": "The Guhtwo Tail",
  "quest.475548D23419D0BB.quest_desc": [
    "From the Guhtwo, after the big nibble feast: a purple tail with a little bulb and a neck tube.",
  ],
  "quest.475548E5D111A9C0.title": "The Little Mewguh Balloon",
  "quest.475548E5D111A9C0.quest_desc": [
    "From Mewguh, after the big nibble feast: a pink balloon that looks just like her.",
  ],
  "quest.4755486171E8C32E.title": "The Cloud Chapel",
  "quest.4755486171E8C32E.quest_desc": [
    "High above a small cloud plaza floats an islet with a little cloud temple: the &dCloud Chapel&r. Find it with your Super Compass (&dTales&r tab) and step into the &bCloud Lift&r. Wheee!",
  ],
  "quest.475548D31981B04C.title": "The Cloud Shepherd",
  "quest.475548D31981B04C.quest_desc": [
    "In the chapel the &fCloud Shepherd&r stands next to the sleeping &dSnuggleheart&r. Talk to him: he'll tell you what the little heart needs.",
  ],
  "quest.4755483F335E4BE7.title": "For the Sparkle",
  "quest.4755483F335E4BE7.quest_desc": [
    "Bring the Cloud Shepherd a &bguh crystal&r. They glimmer in the crystal caves of the Guhmension.",
  ],
  "quest.4755480F0EB4F523.title": "For the Warmth",
  "quest.4755480F0EB4F523.quest_desc": [
    "Bring the Cloud Shepherd a &6golden cheese nibble&r. They fall from the sky during a Cheese Shower (and sometimes they're in a treasure). Warm and chonky!",
  ],
  "quest.47554846932C0D60.title": "For the Softness",
  "quest.47554846932C0D60.quest_desc": [
    "Bring the Cloud Shepherd a &dfluff feather&r. The round Fluff Finches sometimes drop them, in the Guh Fields and the Pink Puffs.",
  ],
  "quest.475548A00FD15CC4.title": "Ba-dum, Ba-dum!",
  "quest.475548A00FD15CC4.quest_desc": [
    "With all three things the &dSnuggleheart&r wakes up and beats again. WAHOOG! From now on it brings all your guhs back from the clouds: &afree and unlimited&r.",
  ],
  "quest.47554834E178FBC6.title": "A Golden Halo",
  "quest.47554834E178FBC6.quest_desc": [
    "The Cloud Shepherd's thank-you: a &6Golden Halo&r that floats above your guh's head. Hold right-click with it to unlock it.",
  ],
  "quest.475548AB8F406261.title": "Cloud Wings",
  "quest.475548AB8F406261.quest_desc": [
    "And two tiny &fCloud Wings&r for its back. Together with the halo your guh is a real little angel guh!",
  ],
  "quest.475548D783BAE268.title": "Back from the Clouds",
  "quest.475548D783BAE268.quest_desc": [
    "Has one of your tame guhs gone up to the clouds? Click the &dSnuggleheart&r and pick it: it comes back with all its hearts, faves, clothes and its diary. Nobody gets forgotten. Nyeg.",
  ],
  "quest.4755480D2BB5BD5A.title": "A Sweet Little Star",
  "quest.4755480D2BB5BD5A.quest_desc": [
    "When a tame guh goes up to the clouds, a glowing &dMemory&r star is left behind. Bring it to the Snuggleheart: then the little heart knows right away who you want back.",
  ],
  "quest.47554806B55E2DC0.title": "Aloha, Lilo-guh!",
  "quest.47554806B55E2DC0.quest_desc": [
    "On the beach of &bGuhwai'i&r stands a house on stilts. That's where &dLilo-guh&r and her big sister &dNani-guh&r live. Last night Lilo-guh saw a shooting star... Talk to her!",
  ],
  "quest.47554886F8BB0F23.title": "A Shooting Star?",
  "quest.47554886F8BB0F23.quest_desc": [
    "Up on top of the island's hill lies a crashed &bcapsule&r. A crater, smoke, an open hatch... and inside, a strange meter. Who could it belong to?",
  ],
  "quest.475548A5B86208B2.title": "INCALCULABLY WAHOOG",
  "quest.475548A5B86208B2.quest_desc": [
    "Inside the capsule stands the &bChonkiness Scanner&r. Put a guh on the plate (or just click: your nearest guh hops on) and watch the &eCHONKINESS LEVEL&r meter: a bit chonky... chonky... very chonky... WAHOOG... &dINCALCULABLY WAHOOG&r! It works on every guh. A guh can never be too chonky!",
  ],
  "quest.475548CE388D7FE5.title": "From the Shelter",
  "quest.475548CE388D7FE5.quest_desc": [
    "Tell Lilo-guh about the capsule. She knows right away who was inside: the little blue guh with four arms from the &aguh shelter&r! She adopts him: from now on his name is &b626-guh&r.",
  ],
  "quest.475548B3F5ACAFC7.title": "Just a Little Mess",
  "quest.475548B3F5ACAFC7.quest_desc": [
    "626-guh has turned the house upside down! Pillow feathers, a knocked-over bucket, coconut shells... It's just a little mess, nothing is broken. Help &dNani-guh&r and click the messy bits away.",
  ],
  "quest.475548CDA3FB2539.title": "Being Sweet Is Pretty Wahoog",
  "quest.475548CDA3FB2539.quest_desc": [
    "626-guh has to learn to be sweet. Show him how: give him a &6coconut&r, a &dpink hibiscus&r and &e8 cheese nibbles&r (right-click him, at the shelter).",
  ],
  "quest.47554849D4A53017.title": "Ohana Means Family",
  "quest.47554849D4A53017.quest_desc": [
    "Go back to Lilo-guh. &d\"Ohana means family. Family means nobody gets left behind... or forgotten. Nyeg.\"&r You get the poster, a ukulele and the island clothes, and 626-guh can come with you!",
  ],
  "quest.47554830868BF526.title": "Experiment 626, Home!",
  "quest.47554830868BF526.quest_desc": [
    "Give 626-guh a &echeese nibble&r at the shelter: then he jumps into your arms and comes home with you. Only once per player! He climbs up walls, hangs from the ceiling and carries twice as much on chores.",
  ],
  "quest.4755488CDC605E0A.title": "Aloha, Nyeg!",
  "quest.4755488CDC605E0A.quest_desc": [
    "Open your 626-guh's guh menu and press &bUkulele&r (or pick the emote): he strums a little song. \"Aloha, nyeg!\"",
  ],
  "quest.475548A988C00653.title": "Strum Strum",
  "quest.475548A988C00653.quest_desc": [
    "Play 626-guh's &bspare ukulele&r yourself (right-click): all the guhs around you start dancing!",
  ],
  "quest.4755487A79DA30D6.title": "Island Clothes",
  "quest.4755487A79DA30D6.quest_desc": [
    "The &dHula Skirt&r, the &dFlower Lei&r, the &b626 Ears with Antennae&r and the &bsurfboard&r: the clothes of Guhwai'i! Hold right-click with them to unlock them for all your guhs.",
  ],
  "quest.4755485E4571BE0E.title": "Up on the Wall!",
  "quest.4755485E4571BE0E.quest_desc": [
    "Hang up the &dIncalculably Wahoog&r poster. (You can make more: paper, light blue and pink dye and glowstone dust. And there's a big painting of it too!)",
  ],
  "quest.475548CAB378B267.title": "Crack, Slurp!",
  "quest.475548CAB378B267.quest_desc": [
    "Under the leaves of a &aGuh Palm&r hang coconuts: green, then yellow, then brown. Pick a brown one (click it) and eat it. Or give it to your guh: guhs love coconut!",
  ],
  "quest.4755489CDB8138AB.title": "Coconut Milk!",
  "quest.4755489CDB8138AB.quest_desc": [
    "A coconut and a glass bottle: &fcoconut milk&r! Cool, sweet, and you feel better right away.",
  ],
  "quest.4755480093B76EFE.title": "A Palm of Your Own",
  "quest.4755480093B76EFE.quest_desc": [
    "Plant a coconut in sand or on grass: a &aGuh Palm&r grows from it, with a little face in the trunk. Click that face: it winks!",
  ],
  "quest.4755486993171576.title": "A Flower Behind Your Ear",
  "quest.4755486993171576.quest_desc": [
    "On Guhwai'i bloom &dpink hibiscus&r, white &fplumeria&r, orange &6birds of paradise&r and purple &5orchids&r. Pick a pink hibiscus!",
  ],
  "quest.475548CF1DEF4B37.title": "Crack, Crack!",
  "quest.475548CF1DEF4B37.quest_desc": [
    "In the warm sand lie &aShelly Eggs&r. At night they go faster... crack, crack! Little Poopshellies and Shellies hatch out of them. Wait nearby and watch them hatch!",
  ],
  "quest.475548C562B008D8.title": "Snorkeling",
  "quest.475548C562B008D8.quest_desc": [
    "Swim in the warm lagoon of Guhwai'i. On the bottom grows a reef of &eCheese Coral&r (near cheese coral you can breathe underwater!), with coral and &dlittle guhfish&r.",
  ],
  "quest.4755484DD53C9320.title": "Guhdex: Guhwai'i",
  "quest.4755484DD53C9320.quest_desc": [
    "Add &b626-guh&r, &dLilo-guh&r and &dNani-guh&r to your Guhdex (just get close).",
  ],
  "quest.475548B7CD7279A5.title": "The Surf Beach",
  "quest.475548B7CD7279A5.quest_desc": [
    "On the beach of a &dGuhwai'i&r island there's sometimes a sunny surf beach: a round hula stage with torches, &6Lilo-guh&r by her surf hut and &6Tiki Guh&r behind his Tiki stand (Super Compass: Tales or Minigames).",
  ],
  "quest.475548EF08ED3EB4.title": "Behind the Mask",
  "quest.475548EF08ED3EB4.quest_desc": [
    "Add &6Tiki Guh&r to your Guhdex (get close enough). What would he look like without his mask?",
  ],
  "quest.475548579EE3B908.title": "First Little Waves",
  "quest.475548579EE3B908.quest_desc": [
    "Surf with Lilo-guh on &aeasy&r: little waves that you catch all by yourself. Stay ahead of the foam!",
  ],
  "quest.475548E4E03B6E67.title": "Paddle Paddle!",
  "quest.475548E4E03B6E67.quest_desc": [
    "Surf on &emedium&r: paddle into the wave with &6W&r when it reaches you. Pump with W and S for speed!",
  ],
  "quest.475548598EBE3049.title": "Big Waves",
  "quest.475548598EBE3049.quest_desc": [
    "Surf on &chard&r: big, fast waves that break quickly. Land your tricks straight!",
  ],
  "quest.4755482852C6537C.title": "Nibble Spin!",
  "quest.4755482852C6537C.quest_desc": [
    "Jump off the crest of a wave with &6space&r (with enough speed) and spin a full circle with &6A/D&r before you land. Grab your board with &6S&r for extra points!",
  ],
  "quest.4755485278CA716D.title": "Through the Tube",
  "quest.4755485278CA716D.quest_desc": [
    "On medium and hard the wave curls over next to the foam: stay high on the wave, just ahead of the foam, and surf through the &dtube&r!",
  ],
  "quest.47554845AA71E7BD.title": "Aloha, Nyeg",
  "quest.47554845AA71E7BD.quest_desc": [
    "Dance the hula to &aAloha, Nyeg&r: a slow moonlight song, just your hips (&6A&r and &6D&r).",
  ],
  "quest.4755482D3A5CC103.title": "Guhla-Hula Rock",
  "quest.4755482D3A5CC103.quest_desc": [
    "Dance to &eGuhla-Hula Rock&r: hips, arms up (&6W&r) and bend your knees (&6S&r), to the beat of the rock'n'roll!",
  ],
  "quest.475548EB6FD94A3D.title": "Wahoog Hula Hop",
  "quest.475548EB6FD94A3D.quest_desc": [
    "Dance to &cWahoog Hula Hop&r: fast, with half beats, and &6space&r on the golden WAHOOG! stars.",
  ],
  "quest.4755488A69176A57.title": "Not One Step Missed",
  "quest.4755488A69176A57.quest_desc": [
    "Dance a whole song on medium or hard without missing a single step. Lilo-guh cries happy tears!",
  ],
  "quest.475548D60B8B8C81.title": "Easy, Medium, Hard!",
  "quest.475548D60B8B8C81.quest_desc": [
    "Surf and dance on all three levels: six rows in the Minigames tab of your Guhdex.",
  ],
  "quest.475548F6E07C469A.title": "A Bag Full of Seashells",
  "quest.475548F6E07C469A.quest_desc": [
    "Save up 20 &dSeashell Coins&r. They jingle so cozily!",
  ],
  "quest.4755481204C5F049.title": "Tiki-Tiki-Nyeg",
  "quest.4755481204C5F049.quest_desc": [
    "Buy something pretty from &6Tiki Guh&r: torches, masks, a tiki statue, thatched roofs, flower garlands, seashell lanterns...",
  ],
  "quest.4755484E34BB269B.title": "Hula at Home",
  "quest.4755484E34BB269B.quest_desc": [
    "Buy the &6Tiki Radio&r (10 Seashell Coins). Right-click: the hula songs of Guhwai'i play, even at home!",
  ],
  "quest.475548F0FC447BA7.title": "Een steigerhuisje",
  "quest.475548F0FC447BA7.quest_desc": [
    "Aan de &9Diepe Guhzee&r in de &dGuhmensie&r staat hier en daar een &fsteigerhuisje&r vol lampions. Daar is het lantaarnfeest... maar je kleine broertje of zusje, &6Kleine Wiebel&r, zakt in elkaar. Je &6superkompas&r (Mijn verhaal) wijst de weg.",
  ],
  "quest.47554840805681BB.title": "Welke hond ben jij?",
  "quest.47554840805681BB.quest_desc": [
    "&6Buurvrouw Mandje&r vertelt het bij het ziekbed: papa is al weken weg om de &dgeneesbloem&r te zoeken. Jij gaat hem achterna! Kies bij &6Kapitein Zoutsnoet&r je &fhond&r (ras, vacht en naam) en het &amaatje&r dat met je meegaat, en vaar uit met De Natte Neus. Njeg, wat een golven...",
  ],
  "quest.475548F335AD3977.title": "Aangespoeld!",
  "quest.475548F335AD3977.quest_desc": [
    "Je wordt wakker op het strand van &bHet Snuffeleiland&r, en je hebt... pootjes?! Op het eiland ben je een hond. &6Jutje Kwispel&r brengt je naar Snuffeldorp. Je eigen spulletjes liggen veilig thuis op je te wachten.",
  ],
  "quest.475548661F0C965A.title": "Dokter Pleisterpoot",
  "quest.475548661F0C965A.quest_desc": [
    "De oude dorpsdokter weet het zeker: de geneesbloem vind je alleen met een &fechte snuffelneus&r. Daarvoor moet je naar de wei.",
  ],
  "quest.475548924BAE3631.title": "Snuffelles",
  "quest.475548924BAE3631.quest_desc": [
    "&6Meester Truffelneus&r leert je snuffelen: houd de snuffeltoets ingedrukt en je neus gaat naar de grond. De &fgeurmeter&r slaat harder uit hoe dichter je bij bent, met een kleur per soort geur. Op de plek zelf graaf je het op.",
  ],
  "quest.4755484ABFAF6563.title": "Wie doet dat toch?",
  "quest.4755484ABFAF6563.quest_desc": [
    "Er valt een emmer om en niemand ziet waarom. Alleen jij ziet het: een ondeugend &abosgeestje&r! Het wordt je maatje, en het wijst je voortaan de weg naar geuren.",
  ],
  "quest.4755488745704E72.title": "Goede daden",
  "quest.4755488745704E72.quest_desc": [
    "De bakker, de visser, de juf, oma en de tuinder zijn iets kwijt. Snuffel het terug! Van elke goede daad leer je een geur en groeit het &aboompje&r van je maatje een stukje.",
  ],
  "quest.475548189E89A494.title": "Het snuffelexamen",
  "quest.475548189E89A494.quest_desc": [
    "Tijd voor je examen bij Meester Truffelneus. Zakken bestaat niet: je neus mag er zo lang over doen als hij wil. Dan ben je een echte &6Snuffelpup&r (rang 1 van 5).",
  ],
  "quest.47554894D344E0BD.title": "Een spoor van papa",
  "quest.47554894D344E0BD.quest_desc": [
    "Bij het boompje ruik je iets bekends... papa is hier geweest! Het lost nog niets op, maar je weet nu waar je moet zoeken. Je krijgt het &8Guhstation&r: daarmee ga je terug naar het eiland wanneer je wilt. Wordt vervolgd, njeg!",
  ],
}
